    "detailed_description": "&quot;The Book&quot; is an old-school-inspired, action-packed first-person shooter set in a pirate world overrun by supernatural entities. Craft and upgrade steampunk-styled magic weapons as you fight your way through.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269000/extras/2a5ff3e08a2f0626ed111a59c42b2d8a.avif?t=1735809311\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat and exploration</strong></h2>Engage in fast-paced combat, unleashing your best arsenal, and seamlessly alternating between frenetic arena battles and exploration. Scour every corner of the environment to discover essential resources for crafting and upgrading your weapons.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269000/extras/a395c4b68201566059ab9cce98115cd4.poster.avif?t=1735809311\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269000/extras/a395c4b68201566059ab9cce98115cd4.webm?t=1735809311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting</strong></h2>In &quot;The Book&quot;, a mysterious manuscript that you have come into possession of, there are instructions for crafting powerful weapons belonging to another time. The full power of these weapons will be necessary to progress in this supernatural world of pirates.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269000/extras/bd2bae6b49448df24e0701642f303788.poster.avif?t=1735809311\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269000/extras/bd2bae6b49448df24e0701642f303788.webm?t=1735809311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Vortex Catalyst</strong></h2>Alternate between your crafted firearms and the mysterious Vortex Catalyst. The Vortex Catalyst acts as a magic grenade launcher and serves as both a support weapon, amplifying firearm damage, and a support for combat. Many upgraded weapons take advantage of the Vortex Catalyst's effects.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269000/extras/0d2d7bb94aa19be4c16d8beeeedbd77b.poster.avif?t=1735809311\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269000/extras/0d2d7bb94aa19be4c16d8beeeedbd77b.webm?t=1735809311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269000/extras/0504dfdf83d65556f15bfb9b9ceb5117.avif?t=1735809311\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;The Book&quot; is an old-school-inspired, action-packed first-person shooter set in a pirate world overrun by supernatural entities. Craft and upgrade steampunk-styled magic weapons as you fight your way through.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269000/extras/2a5ff3e08a2f0626ed111a59c42b2d8a.avif?t=1735809311\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat and exploration</strong></h2>Engage in fast-paced combat, unleashing your best arsenal, and seamlessly alternating between frenetic arena battles and exploration. Scour every corner of the environment to discover essential resources for crafting and upgrading your weapons.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269000/extras/a395c4b68201566059ab9cce98115cd4.poster.avif?t=1735809311\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269000/extras/a395c4b68201566059ab9cce98115cd4.webm?t=1735809311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting</strong></h2>In &quot;The Book&quot;, a mysterious manuscript that you have come into possession of, there are instructions for crafting powerful weapons belonging to another time. The full power of these weapons will be necessary to progress in this supernatural world of pirates.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269000/extras/bd2bae6b49448df24e0701642f303788.poster.avif?t=1735809311\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269000/extras/bd2bae6b49448df24e0701642f303788.webm?t=1735809311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Vortex Catalyst</strong></h2>Alternate between your crafted firearms and the mysterious Vortex Catalyst. The Vortex Catalyst acts as a magic grenade launcher and serves as both a support weapon, amplifying firearm damage, and a support for combat. Many upgraded weapons take advantage of the Vortex Catalyst's effects.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269000/extras/0d2d7bb94aa19be4c16d8beeeedbd77b.poster.avif?t=1735809311\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269000/extras/0d2d7bb94aa19be4c16d8beeeedbd77b.webm?t=1735809311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269000/extras/0504dfdf83d65556f15bfb9b9ceb5117.avif?t=1735809311\" /></span>",
